hese directly.\n- printf-family formatting and `strtoll`/`strtod`/`qsort` are delegated to the platform C library, guaranteeing identical bytes.\n- Faithful bug preservation: the `pfive[-1]` out-of-bounds read reads 0 as in the C build; ignored `multadd` return values in `gethex`; C signed-`char` sign extension in the lexer.\n\n## Verification (all against the CMake-built C `.so`)\n| test | cases | mismatches |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6 API harnesses (load/dump/pack/unpack/values/utf8/hashtable/strbuffer/dtoa/errors) | 212,389 output lines | **0** |\n| random-input load+dump fuzz (full `json_error_t` `memcmp`, all flag combos, truncated buffers, NULs, depth limits) | 240,040 | **0** |\n| `json_dumps` of random doubles × 14 precisions + round-trips | 839,874 | **0** |\n| `gethex` (4 rounding modes × signs) | 160,416 | **0** |\n| `strtod__unused` | 130,120 (+3.7M by the sub-agent) | **0** |\n| `dtoa_r`/`dtoa` all modes/ndigits (sub-agent) | 29.4M | **0** |\n| **allocator call trace** (sizes + order + free/realloc) under a fixed-address arena | 1,205 calls | **0** |\n\n`cargo build --release` completes with **zero warnings and zero errors**; nothing in `c_src/` was modified."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1781,"cache_read_input_tokens":451721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1781,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fbb13b3-6d71-4b14-8197-54b0f0754899","uuid":"fc808240-0d3f-4069-8bfe-264d96068015","timestamp":"2026-08-22T20:52:21.016Z"}
